  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PRSC 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The operation aims to: (i) strengthen the links between Mali&apos;s Growth and Poverty Reduction Strategy Framework and the macroeconomic and budget frameworks, and strengthen public finance management; (ii) strengthen contribution to growth of key sectors (notably financial, private, transport, electricity, cotton and irrigation); and (iii) improve access to basic social services notably health and water and sanitation.</narrative>
  </description>
